<%- include('../partials/head', { title: 'Cambiar contraseña' }) %>
<main class="notes-layout notes-narrow" id="contenido"><header class="notes-top"><a class="notes-brand" href="/cuenta"><img src="/assets/images/brand/isotipo.svg" width="34" height="34" alt=""> SecureVault</a><a class="notes-text-link" href="/perfil">Mi perfil</a></header>
  <div class="notes-heading"><div><p class="notes-kicker">SEGURIDAD</p><h1>Cambiar contraseña</h1><p>Elige una contraseña nueva y diferente a la actual.</p></div></div>
  <section class="notes-paper"><% if (message) { %><div class="auth-message" role="alert"><%= message %></div><% } %><form method="post" action="/perfil/contrasena" class="notes-form"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><label for="currentPassword">Contraseña actual</label><input id="currentPassword" type="password" name="currentPassword" autocomplete="current-password" required><label for="newPassword">Contraseña nueva</label><input id="newPassword" type="password" name="newPassword" minlength="12" autocomplete="new-password" required><label for="confirmPassword">Confirmar contraseña nueva</label><input id="confirmPassword" type="password" name="confirmPassword" minlength="12" autocomplete="new-password" required><p class="notes-help">Mínimo 12 caracteres y máximo 72 bytes UTF-8. Se cerrarán tus otras sesiones.</p><div class="notes-actions"><button class="notes-button" type="submit">Cambiar contraseña</button><a class="notes-secondary" href="/perfil">Cancelar</a></div></form></section>
</main></body></html>
